{"first_name":"Raichel","kind":"onboarding","origin":"dialog","text":"Hi Raichel, welcome to your new project. I coordinate your work. Ask me a question or hand me a task, like researching a topic, drafting a doc, analyzing data, or fixing a bug, and I’ll either answer directly or start threads to work on it in parallel.

Threads run on their own, and you can track them in Overview. I’ll post updates when something finishes or needs you.

You can also tell me how you’d like to work together. Change my instructions, connect your tools and files, set up scheduled updates, or ask for something else entirely."}
